      *---------------------------------------------------------------* NXC20094
       200-UPDT-ESD-SRL.                                                NXC20094
                                                                        NXC20094
           MOVE ORH-COMPANY          TO ORTESDWS-CO-CD.                 NXC20094
           MOVE ORH-BR-NBR           TO ORTESDWS-BR-NBR.                NXC20094
           MOVE ORH-ORDER-NBR        TO ORTESDWS-ORDR-NBR.              NXC20094
           MOVE ORL-LINE-NBR         TO ORTESDWS-ORDR-LINE-NBR.         NXC20094
      *WE ARE NOT PASSING THE DIST/SHIP AS WE WOULD NEED TO FETCH       NXC20094
      *EXISTING VALUE AND THEN COMPARE IT WITH THE NEW/UPDATED DIST/SHP NXC20094
      *ALSO NOT PASSING THEM WOULD TAKE CARE OF MODIFY ORDERS.          NXC20094
      *WHERE ORG WAS 1,1 LATER CHANGED TO 2,1 AND DURING MODIFY         NXC20094
      *IF THERE IS ANOTHER DIST ADDED AND WARRANTY MOVES AGAIN TO 31.   NXC20094
                                                                        NXC20094
           EXEC SQL                                                     NXC20094
                SELECT DIST_NBR,                                        NXC20094
                       SHIP_NBR                                         NXC20094
                  INTO :ORTESDWS-DIST-NBR,                              NXC20094
                       :ORTESDWS-SHIP-NBR                               NXC20094
                FROM ESD_WARR_SERIALS                                   NXC20094
                WHERE CO_CD          = :ORTESDWS-CO-CD                  NXC20094
                  AND BR_NBR         = :ORTESDWS-BR-NBR                 NXC20094
                  AND ORDR_NBR       = :ORTESDWS-ORDR-NBR               NXC20094
                  AND ORDR_LINE_NBR  = :ORTESDWS-ORDR-LINE-NBR          NXC20094
                ORDER BY SERL_PROCS_FLG, SERL_ITEM_SEQ_NBR              NXC20094
                FETCH FIRST 1 ROW ONLY                                  NXC20094
           END-EXEC.                                                    NXC20094
                                                                        NXC20094
           MOVE SQLCODE                   TO SQLCODE-STATUS.            NXC20094
           EVALUATE TRUE                                                AXZ24292
               WHEN SQLCODE-NORESP                                      AXZ24292
               WHEN SQLCODE-NOT-FOUND                                   AXZ24292
                    CONTINUE                                            NXC21190
               WHEN OTHER                                               NXC20094
                 MOVE '200-UPDT-ESD-SRL' TO SYWDB2-EXTRA-MESSAGE-1      NXC20094
                 MOVE 'ERROR SELECT ON ESD_WARR_SERIALS'                NXC20094
                                          TO SYWDB2-EXTRA-MESSAGE-2     NXC20094
